# The clock gives three tics per frame (as a window on a slow machine):
# the engine runs three tics at each frame, and the screen wipe takes
# three steps. From the title, through the menus, to a new game, then
# idclev12 to E1M2: two wipes.
20  shot title.ppm      # the title, after the first demo was cut
50  press escape        # opens the main menu
70  press enter         # New Game
90  press enter         # Knee-Deep in the Dead
110 press enter         # Hurt me plenty
113 shot wipe1.ppm      # the screen melts into the level
116 shot wipe2.ppm
150 press i
152 press d
154 press c
156 press l
158 press e
160 press v
162 press 1
164 press 2
167 shot wipe3.ppm      # the melt into E1M2
200 shot e1m2.ppm
220 quit
